{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Query.swift#L56","fileName":"Query.swift"},"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Query"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"Query"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/query"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A description of the entities to visit and the components to read from each.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/==(_:_:)"],"anchor":"Operators","title":"Operators"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/init(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/init(filter:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/filter","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/first"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/added(_:since:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/allowing(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/anyOf(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/changed(_:since:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/filtered(by:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/hash(into:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/related(_:to:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/with(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/without(_:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Sequence-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityQueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntitiesView"],"anchor":"Querying-and-Updating-Entities","generated":true,"title":"Querying and Updating Entities"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SH","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/ST"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Query","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"QueryTerm","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A query has ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"terms"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"filter"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":". Each term is either a component type, which an entity must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hold and whose value the query reads, or an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" group, which an entity matches by holding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at least one of its types. The filter adds conditions that read nothing: types an entity must","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or must not hold, components added or changed since a tick, and relations. An entity matches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the query when it matches every term and passes the filter.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A query doesn’t belong to any world. Build it once, store it, compare it with another, and run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it against any world. The following example finds the entities that move and aren’t frozen:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"comet\"), Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"statue\"), Position(x: 4, y: 2), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Frozen())","world.spawn(Name(value: \"moon\"), Position(x: 9, y: 9))","","let movers = Query(Name.self, Position.self, Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self)","","var names: [String] = []","for (_, name, _, _) in world.query(movers) {","    names.append(name.value)","}","print(names)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"comet\"]\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each row starts with the entity, labeled ","type":"text"},{"code":"entity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", followed by one value per term in the order","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the query lists them. The statue holds every term but is frozen, and the moon has no velocity.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To change components while you visit them, pass a query to "},{"code":"update(_:over:body:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following example moves every entity that has a velocity and isn’t frozen:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let comet = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 2))","let statue = world.spawn(Position(x: 4, y: 2), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), Frozen())","","world.update(Position.self, over: Query(Velocity.self).without(Frozen.self)) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","    position.y += row.components.dy","}","print(world[Position.self, of: comet])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\"","print(world[Position.self, of: statue])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 4.0, y: 2.0)\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"As a parameter of a system, a query arrives bound to the world the system runs on, and you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iterate it directly. A system spells its filter as types; see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query\/Where","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Queries of one to three terms, each a component or an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf"},{"type":"text","text":" group of two to four types, run"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through code specialized for their exact shape. Other shapes take a general path that does more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"work per entity."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/QueryRow":{"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryRow"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryrow","title":"QueryRow","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"QueryRow"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An entity an update visits, with the components the update reads from it."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/EntitiesView":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the live entities of a world, in slot order."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntitiesView","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/entitiesview","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EntitiesView","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EntitiesView","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"EntitiesView"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Query/init(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type)","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Creates a query of the given terms, with no filter.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/docum